@host = http://localhost:7071
# @host = https://func-bks0.azurewebsites.net

### SDK: DefaultAzureCredential (local: Azure CLI login, Azure: managed identity)
GET {{host}}/api/GetSecret

### SDK: explicit secret name and credential type
GET {{host}}/api/GetSecret?name=secret-sauce&credentialType=DefaultAzureCredential

### SDK: ManagedIdentityCredential only (fails locally: no managed identity endpoint)
GET {{host}}/api/GetSecret?credentialType=ManagedIdentityCredential

### SDK: ChainedTokenCredential (always fails: chain is built with no credentials)
GET {{host}}/api/GetSecret?credentialType=ChainedTokenCredential

### SDK: secret that doesn't exist
GET {{host}}/api/GetSecret?name=does-not-exist

### Raw HTTP: token from IDENTITY_ENDPOINT, then Key Vault REST API (Azure only)
GET {{host}}/api/GetSecretHardWay?name=secret-sauce
